From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: b43: reduce receive ring allocations

Reduce the number of receive ring slots to lower the memory cost of the
b43 driver.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/dma.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/dma.h
@@ -170,7 +170,7 @@ struct b43_dmadesc_generic {
 
 /* DMA engine tuning knobs */
 #define B43_TXRING_SLOTS		256
-#define B43_RXRING_SLOTS		256
+#define B43_RXRING_SLOTS		32
 #define B43_DMA0_RX_FW598_BUFSIZE	(B43_DMA0_RX_FW598_FO + IEEE80211_MAX_FRAME_LEN)
 #define B43_DMA0_RX_FW351_BUFSIZE	(B43_DMA0_RX_FW351_FO + IEEE80211_MAX_FRAME_LEN)
 
